//! The `outline` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS)
//! [shorthand](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Cascade/Shorthand_properties)
//! property sets the style, color, and width of an element's outline.
//!
//! Initial: outline-width: medium; outline-style: none; outline-color: auto. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - auto: Permits the user agent to render a custom outline style, typically the default platform
//! style.
//! - dashed: The outline is a series of short line segments. See
//! https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/outline-style
//! - dotted: The outline is a series of dots. See
//! https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/outline-style
//! - double: The outline is two single lines. The `outline-width` is the sum of the two lines and
//! the space between them. See
//! https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/outline-style
//! - groove: The outline looks as though it were carved into the page. See
//! https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/outline-style
//! - inset: The outline makes the box look as though it were embedded in the page. See
//! https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/outline-style
//! - medium: Same as `3px`. See
//! https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Values/line-width
//! - none: No outline is used. See
//! https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/outline-style
//! - outset: The opposite of `inset`: the outline makes the box look as though it were coming out of
//! the page. See https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/outline-style
//! - ridge: The opposite of `groove`: the outline looks as though it were extruded from the page.
//! See https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/outline-style
//! - solid: The outline is a single line. See
//! https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/outline-style
//! - thick: Same as `5px`. See
//! https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Values/line-width
//! - thin: Same as `1px`. See
//! https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Values/line-width
//!
//! Grammar: <'outline-width'> || <'outline-style'> || <'outline-color'>
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-ui-4/#propdef-outline
//!
//! Author guide: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/outline
//!
//! Purpose and value descriptions adapted from MDN contributors (CC-BY-SA-2.5).
//!
//! Additional value descriptions: Microsoft (MIT).
//!
//! Generated from @webref/css 8.7.8. Do not edit.

